# What the landing page's feature previews share: small looping GIFs, one per feature card, on the designed backdrop.
Set Background //demos/backgrounds/backdrop-16x10.jpg
Set Padding 4%
Set GifWidth 560
Set GifFrameRate 12
Set GifColors 128
Set Subtitles on
Set Voice voicebox:Main
Set ZoomEasing smooth
Set ZoomDuration 600ms
